window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>We defeated fate. Mack chose me. But instead of celebrating, I'm grieving for him…</b></p> <p>Nothing could've prepared me for this new nightmare.</p> <p>All my life, I've wanted answers about the mother I never knew. Now, I'm about to get what I wanted, but it's cost me Mack.</p> <p>It's going to take every bit of strength I possess to overcome a new enemy that threatens everyone I love. I've lost so much already—too much. And all I have to rely on is a power I can't control.</p> <p>Can I discover the strength to be the omega I'd always hoped to be?</p> <p><i>For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
